**/*-actual.png
**/*-diff.png
**/__screenshots__/**/*.actual.png

# ─── Benchmark and research output ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Reports are published deliberately, not swept in by `git add`.
benchmark/results/
benchmark/.cache/
benchmark/corpus/.fetched/
research/experiments/**/out/
research/experiments/**/*.local.*
*.bench.json
!benchmark/results/**/*.published.json

